# Netlify and Vercel Redirects Configuration
# 
# This file provides hosting-level redirects for platforms like Netlify and Vercel.
# These redirects are processed before the application loads, making them faster.
#
# Format: from_path  to_path  [status_code]
#
# Status codes:
#   301 - Permanent redirect (default)
#   302 - Temporary redirect
#
# Examples (uncomment and modify as needed):
# /old-page  /new-page  301
# /blog      /posts     301
# /temp      /new-temp  302

